ence\": \"Combined Type=Income + Category=Consulting + Date range Dec1-31 2024 yielded exactly 2 transactions (tx-6, tx-1), both satisfying all 3 criteria simultaneously. Will verify criteria removal restores full set next.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Missing required field validation lacks user-facing error messages\", \"actual\": \"Submitting the Add Transaction form with empty Description and Amount silently failed to create the transaction (no new row added, dialog stayed open) but no error message, red border, aria-invalid attribute, or toast notification appeared anywhere in the DOM identifying which fields were missing.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Invalid date range (start > end) not rejected or explained\", \"actual\": \"Set From=2024-12-31 and To=2024-12-01 (start later than end). No validation error or explanation was shown; the app silently treated it as a normal filter and displayed 'No transactions found - Try adjusting your filters', identical to a generic empty-result message, not an explanation that the date range itself is invalid.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Missing category validation lacks user-facing error identification\", \"actual\": \"Submitting the Add Transaction form without selecting a Category silently failed to create the transaction (no new row added) but no error message or visual indicator identified the missing category to the user.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-24\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Category deletion not blocked and no reassignment offered for categories in use\", \"actual\": \"Deleted 'Interest Income' category (cat-3) which had 1 assigned transaction (tx-9 'Bank Interest'). Confirmation dialog only warned 'Transactions using this category will not be deleted' with no reassignment option. After confirming delete, tx-9's category field became blank (empty string) in the transactions table, leaving the transaction with no category.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"After creating an Aug 26 2026 (current month) income transaction of $1,234.56, Dashboard month.income updated from $0 to $1,235, month.profit updated to $1,235, and the new transaction appeared at top of Recent Activity list.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Unmarked tax-related on tx-4 'Electric Bill' (-$285.00). 2024 Tax Summary updated: transaction count dropped 18→17, tx-4 no longer appears in the tax transactions list, Deductible Expenses dropped from $36,535.99 to $36,250.99 (exactly -$285), Net Taxable Income increased accordingly, and 'Utilities' category disappeared from the expense breakdown table.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Consulting category (cat-2) now shows 4 transactions totaling $12,034.56 (was 3 transactions, $10,800 before new $1,234.56 transaction was added: 10800+1234.56=12034.56).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicked 'Print Report' on the 2024 Tax Summary; window.print() was invoked successfully (stub confirmed __printCalled=true). No new console errors appeared after the click (still only the pre-existing React key-prop dev warning, count unchanged), confirming no application error occurred.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Each transaction row displays date (e.g. 'Aug 26, 2026'), description, category, reference (or '—' if none), amount (signed, e.g. '+$999.99'), and tax status ('✓' or blank). Page footer shows Total Income (+$48,592.49) and Total Expenses (-$36,535.99) reflecting the current filtered result set.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-21\", \"verdict\": \"